  "job_B2.3.1_20251003_114506": {
    "text": "Leofan men, understanda\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rest cristenra manna gehwylc ah ealra \u00feinga m\u00e6ste \u00f0earfe \u00fe\u00e6t he cunne\nAnd sy\u00f0\u00f0an is eac \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t gehwa understande hwanan he sylf com, & hw\u00e6t he is, & to hwan he\nOf eor\u00f0an gewurdan \u00e6rest geworhte \u00fea \u00f0e we ealle of coman, & to eor\u00f0an we sculan ealle geweor\u00f0an &\nEala, lytel is se fyrst \u00feyses lifes, & ly\u00f0re is, \u00fe\u00e6t we lufia\u00f0 & on wunia\u00f0, & for oft hit wyr\u00f0 ra\u00f0ost\nAc utan don swa us mycel \u00feearf is, tylian \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e us n\u00e6fre ne ateora\u00f0, lufian Godd eallum mode &\nHis wylla is \u00fe\u00e6t we aa \u00e6fter ure agenre \u00feearfe geornlice winnan & \u00fe\u00e6t geearnian \u00fe\u00e6t we to gela\u00f0ode\nUtan don eac swa we \u00feearfe agan, beon mildheorte & \u00e6lmesgeorne & eadmode & so\u00f0f\u00e6ste &\n\u00de\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t we woldan a God lufian & on hine gelyfan & his bebodu healdan & deofol ascunian & his\n\u00deis man beh\u00e6t for \u00e6lcne \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00fee fulluht underfeh\u00f0; & \u00f0eah \u00fe\u00e6t cild for geogo\u00f0e sprecan ne mage\nIs \u00feeah ma manna \u00feinne \u00feearf w\u00e6re \u00fee \u00feises behates gescad ne cunnan.\nTwa word behealda\u00f0 mycel: Abrenuntio & credo.\nLeofan men, for ure ealra \u00feearfe Crist com on \u00feis lif & for ure neode dea\u00f0 \u00ferowode.\n\u00c6r \u00f0am timan n\u00e6s \u00e6nig man on worulde swa m\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t he on an ne sceolde to helle, swa he heonan\nAc mycel ge\u00feolode \u00f0urh his mildheortnesse Crist for ure \u00feearfe \u00fea he let hine sylfne bindan & swingan\nAc he geswutelode swa\u00f0eah \u00fey \u00f0riddan d\u00e6ge \u00fea he of dea\u00f0e aras \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00e6g\u00f0res geweald h\u00e6f\u00f0 ge lifes\nLeofan men, hwa m\u00e6g \u00e6fre o\u00f0rum fur\u00f0or freondscype gecy\u00f0an \u00feonne he his agen feorh gesylle & \u00f0urh\nEalle, we scoldan forweor\u00f0an ecan dea\u00f0e, n\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t Crist for us dea\u00f0 \u00ferowode.\nAc he gebohte us \u00fea ealle mid his deorwur\u00f0an blode of helle wite & h\u00e6f\u00f0 nu \u00feurh his gyfe manna\n\u00d0onne ne \u00feince us \u00e6fre to mycel, ac us m\u00e6g aa to lytel, \u00fe\u00e6t we Godes \u00feances to Gode gedon, for\u00f0am\nLeofan men, utan don swa us \u00feearf is, beon geornfulle ure agenre \u00feearfe, geswican ure synna, &\nAnd utan understandan \u00fe\u00e6t nis nan rihtra dom \u00feonne ure \u00e6lc o\u00f0rum beode \u00fe\u00e6t we willan \u00fe\u00e6t man us\nAnd utan ge\u00feencan \u00fe\u00e6t we habba\u00f0 \u00e6nne heofonlicne f\u00e6der & \u00fe\u00e6t we syndan \u00feurh cristendom ealle\n\u00d0y ne misbeode cristenra manna \u00e6nig o\u00f0rum ealles to swy\u00f0e, for\u00f0am eal \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig man o\u00f0rum her on\nAc utan gladian georne God \u00e6lmihtigne, habban us so\u00f0e sibbe & some gem\u00e6ne & don a to gode \u00fe\u00e6ne\nUtan gyman \u00fe\u00e6t we urne cristendom cl\u00e6nlice gehealdan & aweorpan alcne h\u00e6\u00f0endom & habban rihtne\n\u00d0onne is \u00fe\u00e6rto eacan gyt to understandenne \u00fe\u00e6t we eac eadmodlice eal gel\u00e6stan on geargerihtan \u00fe\u00e6t\n& se \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic ymbe spece, he de\u00f0 him sylfum mycle \u00f0earfe.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t is witodlice ful so\u00f0, gelyfe se \u00f0e wylle, an tima cym\u00f0 ure \u00e6ghwylcum \u00fe\u00e6t us w\u00e6re leofre\nAc \u00fe\u00e6nne we sculan habban anfeald lean \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee we on life \u00e6r geworhton.\nWa \u00f0am \u00feonne \u00fee \u00e6r geearnode helle wite.\n\u00d0\u00e6r is ece bryne grimme gemencged, & \u00f0\u00e6r is ece gryre; \u00f0\u00e6r is ece \u00e6ce, & \u00f0\u00e6r is sorgung & sargung,\nWa \u00f0am \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r sceal wunian on wite.\nBetere him w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t he man n\u00e6re \u00e6fre geworden \u00feonne he gewurde.\nNis se man on life \u00fee areccan m\u00e6ge ealle \u00fea yrm\u00f0a \u00fee se gebidan sceal se \u00f0e on \u00f0a witu ealles\n\u00d0yder sculan manslagan, & \u00f0ider sculan mansworan; \u00feyder sculan \u00e6wbrecan & \u00f0a fulan forlegenan;\nFor Godes lufan we bidda\u00f0 manna gehwylcne \u00fe\u00e6t he be\u00feence georne hine sylfne.\nUtan gecyrran georne fram synnum & God biddan inweardre heortan \u00fe\u00e6t he us gebeorge wi\u00f0 \u00feone\nUtan forfleon geornlice man & mor\u00f0or & manslihtas, stala & strudunga & searacr\u00e6ftas, & utan\nUtan andettan ure synna urum scriftan \u00fea hwile \u00fee we magan & motan, & betan & a geswican & don\n\u00deonne beorge we us sylfum wi\u00f0 ece wite, & geearnia\u00f0 us heofona rice.",
